cosmolith for Regolith
======================

This package uses Debian's 3.0 (quilt) format. Voulage prepares the upstream
source tarball from the repository with debian/ excluded, then builds the
Debian tarball from this directory.

Rust dependencies are vendored during the clean/source-preparation phase into
vendor.tar. The binary build extracts that archive and builds Cargo offline.
Run a local binary build with:

  dpkg-buildpackage -b -us -uc -d

For a source package, use Voulage's source build flow (debuild -S -sa -us -uc)
so the upstream tarball and Debian tarball are generated together. A source
build requires network access for the initial cargo vendor step; subsequent
binary builds use the recorded vendor.tar archive.
